# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in values as needed.
# ".env" is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
#
# Everything here is OPTIONAL — the server works with no .env at all.
# This file exists to document which environment variables the project reads.

# Override where the cached session token is stored.
# Default: <repo>/.mm/mm_session.pickle
# MONARCH_SESSION_FILE=

# Optional: your Monarch MFA/2FA secret (the base32 string behind the QR code,
# from Settings -> Security -> Enable MFA -> "Two-factor text code").
# Setting this lets auth_setup.py generate login codes automatically instead of
# prompting you each time. This is a SECRET — keep it only in your local .env.
# MONARCH_MFA_SECRET=
